sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as LessonController
  participant Learning as LearningService
  participant Enrollment as EnrollmentService
  participant Progress as LearningProgressRepository
  participant Signal as LearningSignalPublisher

  Student->>Web: Mark lesson complete
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/lessons/{lessonId}/complete
  Api->>Learning: completeLesson(studentId, lessonId)
  Learning->>Enrollment: Require enrolled student
  Learning->>Progress: Upsert lesson progress
  Learning->>Progress: Recalculate course progress
  Learning->>Signal: Append LESSON_COMPLETED signal
  Learning-->>Api: ProgressResponse
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Student: Update progress UI
